    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        164,
        1808,
        1882,
        2560
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Please let me know in what cases your agency is required to use registered mail and whether or not the use of certified mail would be acceptable to you. Also kindly furnish me with an estimate of the annual cost incurred by your agency through legally required use of registered mail, if you can arrive at such a figure. In addition, I would like to receive from you the citations of the statutes which require your agency to use registered mail.",
